5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know what it's like for other people! I'll look into the supervised mornings on the next lane and the visit to the station block's bin house.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I think we should be careful about the costs, so I'll check the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs, and the block ledger of refuse-point expenses.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,I'll take a look at the ward complaint log for this point and the station block's meeting minutes to see how others handled the drama.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I'll check the truck arrival time from the crew leader and the statements at the residents' meeting to see what people actually think.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I will look into the measurements of the five frontages and the ward filing requirements per the installations clerk to understand the physical and legal constraints.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Rin,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,Does anyone else feel we should check the residents' meeting statements? I'm worried about how we'll all get along.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"May is already on that, Midori. I'm more interested in whether the other blocks are still speaking to each other after their ""solutions.""","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,Exactly. I'll find out if people are actually willing to play by the rules or if it's just talk.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,The physical layout is the most objective starting point; we cannot discuss a new arrangement without knowing exactly how much space we have to work with.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,I just want it to stop smelling bad in the summer! I hope the bin house visit tells me if that actually works.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I hope so too, Rin. I just want us to find a way that feels fair for everyone's wallet and doesn't cause any stress.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Fairness is a nice goal, but let's be realistic; we just need a system that doesn't end in another shouting match.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I'll make sure we don't end up with a plan that just dumps all the hard work on one person.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"Consistency is key. If we are to implement a change, it must be based on the actual requirements of the ward office, not just our preferences.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,I'm all set! I can't wait to see what I find out about the other lanes!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'm ready too. I hope the financial information helps us make a decision that everyone can comfortably agree to.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'm satisfied with my choices. Let's see if the records reveal any warnings we should heed before we commit to anything.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,"I'm good to go. Let's just hope the crew leader is honest about those times, or we're all going to be waking up way too early.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I have everything I need. I will wait for the results of our research before proposing a logical path forward.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
